      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAN DO GRACE (5) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Tag Along (25.91) in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Capable of going well again. APTITUDE (1) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only 0.8 lengths from the winner Paw Nilbert in second(25.49) at Ballarat. Has never missed the frame from three starts from this draw, including a win. Expected to feature again. PROVISIONAL (6) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (24.22) in a Grade 7 at Horsham. Has ability and is one of the better chances. GENERATOR (2) can sneak into the finish.",
